 6 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that middle ran 169% of normal in May to June, then fell to 50% in September to October. In 2026 so far, February to March sits at 52% and June to July at 100%. Grid 15440 had its driest year in 2005 at 50%.</p>"}
